{{define "contractPane"}}
<section class="pane" id="contracts" hidden>
<div class="card section-intro"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Contract coverage</h2><p>Which specified inputs and responses have the tests exercised?</p></div><label class="view-filter">Show <select data-filter-mode><option value="all">All conditions</option><option value="attention">Gaps and uncertainty</option><option value="covered">Covered conditions</option></select></label></div>
<p class="subtle">A condition is one case described by a contract, such as a field being omitted or an enum value being used. <strong>One test run can cover many conditions.</strong> Expand an operation to see its cases and the runs that supplied evidence.</p>
<div class="legend"><span><i class="dot covered"></i>Covered: valid evidence from a passing run</span><span><i class="dot gap"></i>Gap: no qualifying evidence</span><span><i class="dot uncertain"></i>Uncertain: evidence is inconclusive</span></div>
<details class="technical"><summary>Scope and complete catalogue</summary><p>Coverage is limited to supplied contracts. A covered condition may also have observations from failed runs. Mock coverage does not verify the real provider. Unsupported and excluded conditions are listed under measurement limits, not counted as test failures.</p>{{if .Contracts}}{{if not .Contracts.Complete}}<p class="note">This snapshot is incomplete; its coverage is provisional.</p>{{end}}{{end}}<div class="links"><a href="../contract-coverage.md">Readable catalogue</a><a href="../contract-coverage.json">All keys and evidence (JSON)</a></div></details></div>
{{range .ContractSpecs}}<article class="card filter-group" data-api-search="{{.APIID}} {{.SchemaID}} {{.Origin}} {{.TargetKind}}" data-search="{{.APIID}} {{.SchemaID}} {{.Origin}} {{.TargetKind}}"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>{{.APIID}}</h2><p class="subtle">{{if eq .Origin "dependency"}}Dependency{{if eq .TargetKind "mock"}} mock assumptions{{else}} observations{{end}}{{else}}Provided API{{end}} · {{.TargetKind}} target</p></div><div class="counts">{{template "conditionCounts" .Counts}}{{if .UnexpectedViolations}}<span class="badge fail">{{.UnexpectedViolations}} contract mismatches</span>{{end}}</div></div>
<details class="technical"><summary>Contract and measurement details</summary><p class="subtle break">Schema {{.SchemaID}} · revision {{.Revision}} · {{.Dialect}}</p>{{if not .DenominatorKnown}}<p class="note">The measurable contract scope is unknown or partial.</p>{{end}}{{range .Notes}}<p>{{.}}</p>{{end}}</details>
<div class="operations">{{range .Operations}}<details class="operation filter-group" id="{{.ID}}" data-search="{{.Name}}"><summary><strong>{{.Name}}</strong>{{template "conditionCounts" .Counts}}{{if .Violations}}<span class="badge fail">{{len .Violations}} contract mismatches</span>{{end}}</summary><div class="operation-body">
{{range .Groups}}<details class="condition-group filter-group" data-search="{{.Label}}"><summary><span>{{.Label}}</span>{{template "conditionCounts" .Counts}}</summary><div class="condition-list">{{range .Rows}}<details class="condition-row filter-leaf" data-state="{{.State}}" data-attention="{{.Attention}}" data-search="{{.Operation}} {{.Phase}} {{.Field}} {{.Label}} {{.Family}} {{.Condition}} {{.State}} {{.Key}} {{.OperationKey}} {{.Location}} {{.Reason}}{{range .Evidence}} {{.TestName}} {{.AttemptID}} {{.FlowID}} {{.InstanceLocation}} {{.Reason}}{{end}}"><summary><span><strong>{{.Field}}</strong><span class="condition-label">{{.Label}}</span></span>{{template "conditionState" .State}}</summary><div class="condition-detail">
{{if .Reason}}<p class="note">{{.Reason}}</p>{{end}}
{{if .Evidence}}<h4>Evidence from test runs</h4>{{range .Evidence}}<div class="sample"><a data-reveal href="{{.TestURL}}">{{.TestName}}</a><p class="subtle">{{.Result}} · test {{.Outcome}} · message validation {{.Validation}}{{if .CaptureIncomplete}} · incomplete capture{{end}}{{if .TransportError}} · transport failure{{end}}{{if .InstanceLocation}} · {{.InstanceLocation}}{{end}}</p>{{if .Reason}}<p class="subtle">{{.Reason}}</p>{{end}}</div>{{end}}{{else}}<p class="subtle">No matching observation recorded for this condition.</p>{{end}}
<details class="technical"><summary>Condition identity and raw evidence</summary><p class="subtle break">Key: {{.Key}}<br>Schema location: {{.Location}}<br>Feasibility: {{.Feasibility}} · {{.AppliesWhen}}</p>{{range .Evidence}}<p class="subtle"><a href="../{{.Path}}">Attempt JSON</a> · flow {{.FlowID}} · {{.Phase}}</p>{{end}}</details></div></details>{{end}}</div></details>{{end}}
{{if .Violations}}<details class="condition-group filter-group"><summary><span>Unexpected contract violations</span><span class="badge fail">{{len .Violations}}</span></summary>{{range .Violations}}<div class="note filter-leaf" data-attention="true" data-state="violation" data-search="{{.Operation}} {{.Reason}} {{.Evidence.TestName}}"><a data-reveal href="{{.Evidence.TestURL}}">{{.Evidence.TestName}}</a> · {{.Evidence.Phase}}: {{.Reason}}</div>{{end}}</details>{{end}}
{{if .ExpectedViolations}}<details class="technical"><summary>{{len .ExpectedViolations}} deliberately invalid inputs</summary><p class="subtle">Generated rejection checks deliberately break a request rule. These are not unexpected contract defects and do not count toward valid-input coverage.</p>{{range .ExpectedViolations}}<p><a data-reveal href="{{.Evidence.TestURL}}">{{.Evidence.TestName}}</a> · {{.Reason}}</p>{{end}}</details>{{end}}
</div></details>{{else}}<p class="empty">No measurable operations are available for this contract.</p>{{end}}</div></article>{{else}}<div class="card empty">No supplied contracts are available to measure.</div>{{end}}
{{if .RejectionOperations}}<article class="card filter-group" data-search="generated invalid input rejection"><h2>Invalid-input coverage</h2><p class="subtle">Separate from valid-input coverage above: did the service reject each generated invalid request with the expected response? These are the supported mutations from the selected scenario, not every possible invalid input.</p><div class="operations">{{range .RejectionOperations}}<details class="operation filter-group" id="{{.ID}}" data-search="{{.Name}}"><summary><strong>{{.Name}}</strong><span class="counts"><span class="count covered">{{.Covered}} rejected as expected</span>{{if .Failed}}<span class="count fail">{{.Failed}} failed</span>{{end}}{{if .NotCovered}}<span class="count gap">{{.NotCovered}} not run</span>{{end}}</span></summary><div class="operation-body">{{range .Rows}}<details class="condition-row filter-leaf" data-attention="{{.Attention}}" data-state="{{.State}}" data-search="{{.Operation}} {{.Field}} {{.Label}} {{.Location}} {{.Constraint}} {{.State}} {{.Key}}{{range .Evidence}} {{.TestName}} {{.Reason}}{{end}}"><summary><span><strong>{{.Field}}</strong><span class="condition-label">{{.Label}}</span></span><span class="badge {{if eq .State "failed"}}fail{{else if ne .State "covered"}}neutral{{end}}">{{if eq .State "covered"}}Rejected as expected{{else if eq .State "failed"}}Failed{{else}}Not run{{end}}</span></summary><div class="condition-detail"><p>Expected HTTP status: {{.ExpectedStatuses}}</p>{{range .Evidence}}<div class="sample"><a data-reveal href="{{.TestURL}}">{{.TestName}}</a><p class="subtle">{{.Reason}}</p></div>{{end}}<details class="technical"><summary>Target identity</summary><p class="subtle break">{{.Key}}</p></details></div></details>{{end}}</div></details>{{end}}</div></article>{{end}}
<p class="filter-empty empty" hidden>No conditions match this filter.</p></section>
{{end}}

{{define "conditionCounts"}}<span class="counts"><span class="count covered">{{.Covered}} covered</span>{{if .NotCovered}}<span class="count gap">{{.NotCovered}} gaps</span>{{end}}{{if .Unknown}}<span class="count uncertain">{{.Unknown}} uncertain</span>{{end}}{{if .Unsupported}}<span class="count neutral">{{.Unsupported}} unsupported</span>{{end}}{{if .Excluded}}<span class="count neutral">{{.Excluded}} excluded</span>{{end}}</span>{{end}}
{{define "conditionState"}}<span class="badge {{if eq . "not_covered"}}warn{{else if ne . "covered"}}neutral{{end}}">{{if eq . "covered"}}Covered{{else if eq . "not_covered"}}Gap{{else if eq . "unknown"}}Uncertain{{else if eq . "unsupported"}}Unsupported{{else if eq . "excluded"}}Excluded{{else}}{{.}}{{end}}</span>{{end}}

{{define "testPane"}}<section class="pane" id="tests" hidden>
<div class="card section-intro"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Test runs</h2><p>What ran, what happened, and which requests were sent?</p></div><label class="view-filter">Show <select data-filter-mode><option value="all">All runs</option><option value="attention">Needs attention</option><option value="pass">Passed runs</option></select></label></div><p class="subtle">Each row is one execution. Authored tests come from your test suite; generated checks replay a scenario with an invalid input. <a data-reveal href="#contracts">Contract coverage</a> combines their observations to show which specified cases were exercised.</p></div>
{{range .TestGroups}}<article class="card filter-group" id="{{.ID}}" data-search="{{.Search}}"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>{{if .Generated}}Generated checks{{else}}{{.Name}}{{end}}</h2>{{if .Generated}}<p>Scenario: <strong>{{.Name}}</strong></p><p class="subtle">{{.Baselines}} happy-path baseline · {{.Mutations}} invalid-input checks</p>{{else}}<p class="subtle">Existing test-suite executions</p>{{end}}</div><span class="counts"><span class="count covered">{{.Passed}} passed</span>{{if .Other}}<span class="count fail">{{.Other}} other outcomes</span>{{end}}</span></div>
<div class="operations">{{if .Generated}}{{range .BaselineRuns}}{{template "testRun" .}}{{end}}{{if .Cases}}<details class="operation filter-group" data-search="invalid input generated"><summary><strong>{{.Mutations}} invalid-input checks</strong><span class="counts"><span class="count covered">{{.MutationPassed}} passed</span>{{if .MutationOther}}<span class="count fail">{{.MutationOther}} other outcomes</span>{{end}}</span></summary><div class="operation-body">{{range .Cases}}{{template "testRun" .}}{{end}}</div></details>{{end}}{{else}}{{range .Attempts}}{{template "testRun" .}}{{end}}{{end}}</div></article>{{else}}<div class="card empty">No committed test runs yet.</div>{{end}}<p class="filter-empty empty" hidden>No test runs match this filter.</p></section>{{end}}

{{define "testRun"}}<details class="test-run filter-leaf" id="{{.Anchor}}" data-state="{{.Status}}" data-attention="{{.Attention}}" data-search="{{.Search}}"><summary><span><span class="run-kind">{{.OriginLabel}}</span><strong>{{.DisplayName}}</strong>{{if .Operation}}<span class="condition-label">{{.Operation}}</span>{{end}}</span><span class="run-outcome"><span class="badge {{if ne .Status "pass"}}fail{{end}}">{{if eq .Status "pass"}}Passed{{else}}{{.Status}}{{end}}</span><span class="subtle">{{len .Flows}} exchanges</span>{{if .Incomplete}}<span class="badge warn">Incomplete capture</span>{{end}}{{if eq .ValidationStatus "fail"}}<span class="badge fail">Contract mismatch</span>{{end}}{{if and .Attention (eq .Status "pass") (ne .ValidationStatus "fail") (not .Incomplete)}}<span class="badge warn">Check results need attention</span>{{end}}</span></summary>
<div class="run-body">{{if .Summary}}<p>{{.Summary}}</p>{{end}}
{{if .Coverage}}<div class="links"><span>Related contract coverage:</span>{{range .Coverage}}<a data-reveal href="{{.URL}}">{{.Label}}</a>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
{{if eq .ValidationStatus "expected_rejection"}}<p class="subtle">The request was deliberately invalid. See the assertions below for response-check results.</p>{{else}}<p class="subtle">Contract validation: {{if .ValidationStatus}}{{.ValidationStatus}}{{else}}not recorded{{end}}. Test outcomes and contract checks are separate.</p>{{end}}
{{if .Incomplete}}<p class="note">Capture is incomplete; this run cannot supply a complete passing observation.</p>{{end}}
{{if .Diagnostics}}<details class="technical"><summary>Diagnostics ({{len .Diagnostics}})</summary>{{range .Diagnostics}}<p class="note">{{.}}</p>{{end}}</details>{{end}}
{{if .Assertions}}<details class="technical"><summary>Assertions: {{.ChecksPassed}} passed{{if .ChecksOther}} · {{.ChecksOther}} other results{{end}}</summary><div class="assertions">{{range .Assertions}}<div class="assertion"><strong>{{if .Field}}{{.Field}}{{else if eq .Operator "schema"}}Response contract{{else if eq .ID "expected-rejection"}}Expected rejection status{{else if eq .Operator "status_in"}}Expected response status{{else}}{{.Operator}}{{end}}</strong><span class="badge {{if ne .Result "pass"}}fail{{end}}">{{.Result}}</span>{{if .Message}}<p class="subtle">{{.Message}}</p>{{end}}<span class="subtle break">{{.ID}}{{if .FlowID}} · {{.FlowID}}{{end}}</span></div>{{end}}</div></details>{{else}}<p class="subtle">The test runner reported the outcome; individual assertions were not captured.</p>{{end}}
{{if .Flows}}<h3>Request sequence</h3><p class="subtle">{{if .Chronological}}Ordered by request start time; calls may overlap. Parent links record captured correlation, not proof of application-level causality.{{else}}Capture order is shown because some request timestamps are missing; do not infer chronological order from flow IDs. Parent links record captured correlation.{{end}}</p>{{range .Flows}}<details class="flow"><summary><span>{{.Sequence}}. {{.Operation}}</span><span class="subtle">HTTP {{.Response.Status}}</span></summary><div class="operation-body"><strong>{{.Direction}}</strong><span class="subtle"> · {{.EvidenceLabel}}</span><details class="technical"><summary>Trace and correlation details</summary><p class="subtle break">Flow {{.ID}} · {{.Channel}}{{if .AssetID}} · dependency {{.AssetID}}{{end}}{{if .TraceID}} · trace {{.TraceID}}{{end}}{{if .ParentID}} · parent {{.ParentID}}{{end}}{{if .Correlation}} · test matched by {{.Correlation}}{{end}}{{if .ParentCorrelation}} · parent relationship {{.ParentCorrelation}}{{end}}{{if .ContextSource}} · trace context {{.ContextSource}}{{end}}</p></details></div>{{if .Error}}<p class="note">Transport error: {{.Error}}</p>{{end}}<div class="flow-body">{{template "message" .Request}}{{template "message" .Response}}</div></details>{{end}}{{else}}<p class="empty">No captured traffic.</p>{{end}}
<details class="technical"><summary>Run identity and source evidence</summary><p class="subtle break">{{.Name}}<br>Attempt {{.ID}}{{if .TraceID}} · trace {{.TraceID}}{{end}}<br>Raw contract-validation status: {{.ValidationStatus}}</p>{{with .Exploration}}<p class="subtle break">Generated {{.Mode}} · {{.Version}} · source run {{.SourceRunID}} · source attempt {{.SourceAttemptID}} · source hash {{.SourceSHA256}}</p>{{range .Notes}}<p class="note">{{.}}</p>{{end}}{{end}}<div class="links"><a href="{{.EvidenceURL}}">Canonical attempt JSON</a><a href="{{.MarkdownURL}}">Readable test page</a></div></details></div></details>{{end}}
